            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;&#xa;This system is designed to simplify and automate the daily operations of a gym. It &#xa;helps manage members, track attendance, and handle administrative tasks efficiently. By&#xa;providing separate access for admins and users, the system ensures secure management, &#xa;accurate records, and a smoother experience for both gym staff and members.&#xa;&lt;/html&gt;&#xa;"/>
